 * <a href="https://man.openbsd.org/ssh.1">ssh(1)</a>, <a href="https://man.openbsd.org/ssh-keygen.1">ssh-keygen(1)</a>, <a href="https://man.openbsd.org/sshd.8">sshd(8)</a>: fix a number of missing includes
   required by the XMSS code on some platforms.

 * <a href="https://man.openbsd.org/sshd.8">sshd(8)</a>: cache timezone data in capsicum sandbox.

