 * regress tests: unbreak key-options.sh test on platforms without
   openpty(3). <a href="https://bugzilla.mindrot.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2856">bz#2856</a>

 * use getrandom(2) for PRNG seeding when built without OpenSSL.

