</section>

<section>
  <h2>Cards</h2>
  <p>These wrap onto new rows as the window narrows, which shoves anyone standing on them.</p>
  <div>
    <div><p><b>Card one</b></p><p>Borders are solid. Walk the top edge or get trapped inside.</p></div>
    <div><p><b>Card two</b></p><p>Buttons and form fields are solid too.</p></div>
    <div><p><b>Card three</b></p><p>Text is a floor you can land on but walk through.</p></div>
    <div><p><b>Card four</b></p><p>Throw a walker up here.</p></div>
