						<td><div><p><span>void</span><span> </span><span>CacheThrashThreadProc</span><span>(</span><span>THREAD_ARGS</span><span>*</span><span> </span><span>pArgs</span><span>)</span></p><p><span>{</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>// Allocate a scratch buffer to help with thrashing L2 cache.</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>BYTE</span><span>*</span><span> </span><span>pCacheThrashBuffer</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>(</span><span>BYTE</span><span>*</span><span>)</span><span>MmAllocatePhysicalMemoryEx</span><span>(</span><span>MEM_REGION_TITLE</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>0x180000</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>PAGE_READWRITE</span><span> </span><span>|</span><span> </span><span>MEM_LARGE_PAGES</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>NULL</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>MAXULONG_PTR</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>0x20000</span><span>)</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>BYTE</span><span>*</span><span> </span><span>pCacheThrashBuffer2</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>pCacheThrashBuffer</span><span> </span><span>+</span><span> </span><span>0x80000</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>BYTE</span><span>*</span><span> </span><span>pCacheThrashBuffer3</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>pCacheThrashBuffer</span><span> </span><span>+</span><span> </span><span>0x100000</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>// Loop until we're told to exit.</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>while</span><span> </span><span>(</span><span>pArgs</span><span>-&gt;</span><span>bRunCacheThrashing</span><span> </span><span>!=</span><span> </span><span>FALSE</span><span>)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>{</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>for</span><span> </span><span>(</span><span>int</span><span> </span><span>i</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>0</span><span>;</span><span> </span><span>i</span><span> </span><span>&lt;</span><span> </span><span>3</span><span>;</span><span> </span><span>i</span><span>++</span><span>)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>{</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>// Walk the entire scratch buffer and try to fetch it into CPU cache.</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>int</span><span> </span><span>offset</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>0</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>while</span><span> </span><span>(</span><span>offset</span><span> </span><span>&lt;</span><span> </span><span>0x80000</span><span>)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>{</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>// Zero three distinct blocks.</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>__dcbz</span><span>(</span><span>offset</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>pCacheThrashBuffer</span><span>)</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>__dcbz</span><span>(</span><span>offset</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>pCacheThrashBuffer2</span><span>)</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>__dcbz</span><span>(</span><span>offset</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>pCacheThrashBuffer3</span><span>)</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>offset</span><span> </span><span>+=</span><span> </span><span>0x80</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>}</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>}</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>}</span></p><p><span>}</span></p></div></td>
