				</td>
						<td><div><p><span>void</span><span> </span><span>CipherTextObservationThreadProc</span><span>(</span><span>THREAD_ARGS</span><span>*</span><span> </span><span>pArgs</span><span>)</span></p><p><span>{</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>// Setup our hypervisor cipher text watch pointer.</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>volatile</span><span> </span><span>DWORD</span><span>*</span><span> </span><span>pCipherTextPtr</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>(</span><span>volatile</span><span> </span><span>DWORD</span><span>*</span><span>)</span><span>(</span><span>0xA0030000</span><span> </span><span>+</span><span> </span><span>HV_SEG3_OVERWRITE_OFFSET</span><span>)</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>// Flush cache and fetch the starting value.</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>__dcbf</span><span>(</span><span>0</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>(</span><span>const</span><span> </span><span>void</span><span>*</span><span>)</span><span>pCipherTextPtr</span><span>)</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>DWORD </span><span>lastCipherTextValue</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>*</span><span>pCipherTextPtr</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>volatile</span><span> </span><span>DWORD</span><span>*</span><span> </span><span>pBlockCounter</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>(</span><span>volatile</span><span> </span><span>DWORD</span><span>*</span><span>)</span><span>&amp;</span><span>pArgs</span><span>-&gt;</span><span>CipherTextBlockCounter</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>// Loop until we're told to exit.</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>while</span><span> </span><span>(</span><span>pArgs</span><span>-&gt;</span><span>bRunCacheThrashing</span><span> </span><span>!=</span><span> </span><span>FALSE</span><span>)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>{</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>for</span><span> </span><span>(</span><span>int</span><span> </span><span>i</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>0</span><span>;</span><span> </span><span>i</span><span> </span><span>&lt;</span><span> </span><span>10000</span><span>;</span><span> </span><span>i</span><span>++</span><span>)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>{</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>// Flush any cached data for the cipher text observation pointer.</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>__dcbf</span><span>(</span><span>0</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>(</span><span>const</span><span> </span><span>void</span><span>*</span><span>)</span><span>pCipherTextPtr</span><span>)</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>// Fetch the cipher text for the area of the hypervisor we want to overwrite and check if another block has been written.</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>DWORD </span><span>test</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>*</span><span>pCipherTextPtr</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>if</span><span> </span><span>(</span><span>test</span><span> </span><span>!=</span><span> </span><span>lastCipherTextValue</span><span>)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>{</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>lastCipherTextValue</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>test</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>(</span><span>*</span><span>pBlockCounter</span><span>)</span><span>++</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>}</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>// Once we observe 15 different cipher text values bail out.</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>if</span><span> </span><span>(</span><span>*</span><span>pBlockCounter</span><span> </span><span>==</span><span> </span><span>15</span><span>)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>{</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>goto</span><span> </span><span>Exit</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>}</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>}</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>}</span></p><p><span>Exit</span><span>:</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>ExTerminateThread</span><span>(</span><span>0</span><span>)</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>}</span></p></div></td>
					</tr>
				</tbody></table>
